  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile multimodal models with pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_019) achieve the highest accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests replacing avgpool aggregation with transformer aggregation while keeping RNA/image encoders and fusion method the same. This isolates the effect of aggregation strategy, a critical design choice, to determine if more complex aggregation improves performance. It balances exploitation (building on config_019's success) with exploration of transformer aggregation, which may capture richer interactions between modalities."
}

